    "description": "Chapel, level 2 of 3: L1 plus flourish 2. Needs scaffolding: 13 tall (the bell cote; the nave roof is 9). Over budget: 440 blocks vs 210 (first build 370 vs 170; 7 wide instead of 5, for two pews a side). Stone chapel (stone bricks on a cobblestone plinth, buttresses, spruce gable roof) whose front gable rises into a bell cote; door under a stone hood, lancet windows, pews, an altar; L2 adds the bell, runner, lectern, candles, lanterns, flower boxes; L3 stained glass oculi, banners, more candles and flowers. Not yet builder-tested: bell, candle, cornflower, dandelion, lectern, lily_of_the_valley, oxeye_daisy. Decoration step adds: item.",
